{"id":"06923f74277e2042","group":"72","path":"72/72-thm-resolution-restriction.md","title":"部分赋值限制不增反驳行数与宽度","display":"thm-resolution-restriction — 部分赋值限制不增反驳行数与宽度","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-thm-resolution-restriction","aliases":["72-thm-resolution-restriction"],"display":"thm-resolution-restriction — 部分赋值限制不增反驳行数与宽度","depends_on":["[[72-df-clause-restriction]]","[[72-df-resolution-width]]"],"chapter":"VIII","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.VIII §9.2, print607–612/PDF619–624; full local subclause-tracking proof","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"statement-and-local-argument-reviewed; not-machine-checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"review_2026_10_22_deep":"新增：接口、局部推导与来源边界逐项登记"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-thm-resolution-restriction"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-thm-resolution-restriction</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-resolution-restriction — 部分赋值限制不增反驳行数与宽度"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e9bb16015e70c461\" href=\"?note=e9bb16015e70c461\" title=\"72-df-clause-restriction\">72-df-clause-restriction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ab6e61983fd840a5\" href=\"?note=ab6e61983fd840a5\" title=\"72-df-resolution-width\">72-df-resolution-width</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"VIII"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.VIII §9.2, print607–612/PDF619–624; full local subclause-tracking proof"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"statement-and-local-argument-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"review_2026_10_22_deep","html":"新增：接口、局部推导与来源边界逐项登记"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ResRefutation}(\\pi,F)\">\\(\\operatorname{ResRefutation}(\\pi,F)\\)</span>；ρ为有限部分赋值。反驳只允许输入子句及二元归结，不把弱化偷偷加入规则。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists\\pi&#39;\\in\\mathsf{Clause}^{&lt;\\omega}\\\n\\bigl[\\operatorname{ResRefutation}(\\pi&#39;,F\\!\\upharpoonright\\rho)\\land\n\\operatorname{lh}(\\pi&#39;)\\le\\operatorname{lh}(\\pi)\\land\\operatorname{wd}(\\pi&#39;)\\le\\operatorname{wd}(\\pi)\\bigr].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists\\pi&#39;\\in\\mathsf{Clause}^{&lt;\\omega}\\\n\\bigl[\\operatorname{ResRefutation}(\\pi&#39;,F\\!\\upharpoonright\\rho)\\land\n\\operatorname{lh}(\\pi&#39;)\\le\\operatorname{lh}(\\pi)\\land\\operatorname{wd}(\\pi&#39;)\\le\\operatorname{wd}(\\pi)\\bigr].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>沿原反驳行归纳，对每条未被ρ满足的原子句，维护已经导出的、包含于其限制的一个子句。输入行直接使用限制输入。若枢轴被赋值，复制与该值相反的父子句所维护的子句；若枢轴未赋值且某个维护子句已没有枢轴，复制它；否则对两个维护子句按该枢轴真正归结。每个原行至多增一条新行，子句从不比对应原行宽。末行空子句只能维护为空，得到反驳。这样处理避免把“删文字”误当作允许的弱化规则。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-clause-restriction","status":"resolved","id":"e9bb16015e70c461","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-clause-restriction]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-resolution-width","status":"resolved","id":"ab6e61983fd840a5","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-resolution-width]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\operatorname{ResRefutation}(\\pi,F)","display":false},{"tex":"\\exists\\pi'\\in\\mathsf{Clause}^{<\\omega}\\\n\\bigl[\\operatorname{ResRefutation}(\\pi',F\\!\\upharpoonright\\rho)\\land\n\\operatorname{lh}(\\pi')\\le\\operatorname{lh}(\\pi)\\land\\operatorname{wd}(\\pi')\\le\\operatorname{wd}(\\pi)\\bigr].","display":true}],"bytes":1782,"backlinks":[{"id":"e6c99e2646691c7d","anchor":"ref-96","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"VIII章新增8项：[[72-df-clause-restriction]] · [[72-df-polynomially-padded-proof-system]] · [[72-df-resolution-width]] · [[72-lem-clause-restriction-semantics]] · [[72-thm-polynomial-boundedness-simulation]] · [[72-thm-polynomial-padding-comparison]] · [[72-thm-proof-system-join-universal]] · [[72-thm-resolution-restriction]]"},{"id":"6aa9c9e25ba49583","anchor":"ref-92","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"VIII章新增8项：[[72-df-clause-restriction]] · [[72-df-polynomially-padded-proof-system]] · [[72-df-resolution-width]] · [[72-lem-clause-restriction-semantics]] · [[72-thm-polynomial-boundedness-simulation]] · [[72-thm-polynomial-padding-comparison]] · [[72-thm-proof-system-join-universal]] · [[72-thm-resolution-restriction]]"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-92","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"VIII章新增8项：[[72-df-clause-restriction]] · [[72-df-polynomially-padded-proof-system]] · [[72-df-resolution-width]] · [[72-lem-clause-restriction-semantics]] · [[72-thm-polynomial-boundedness-simulation]] · [[72-thm-polynomial-padding-comparison]] · [[72-thm-proof-system-join-universal]] · [[72-thm-resolution-restriction]]"}],"outgoing":["e9bb16015e70c461","ab6e61983fd840a5"]}